{emailSubject}Email Verification Request - {$email}{/emailSubject}
{if $firstTime}
<h3>Welcome to {$siteName}</h3>
<p>
  Your account associated with {$email} address was successfully created.
</p>
{else}
<h3>Verification of email address {$email}</h3>
{/if}
<p>
    {$siteName} would like to verify your email address.
    Email verification is necessary to ensure correct functionality of all its services.
    You may confirm the validity of your email by following this link: <a href="{$link}">{$link}</a>.
    The link will be active until {$expiresAfter}.
    A new link can be sent to you if you request the email validation in {$siteName} again.
</p>
<hr>
<p>
    All your data, including the email address, are stored in compliance with GDPR.
</p>
